        "headline": {
          "en": "Dimir Erayo",
          "zh": "蓝黑伟代"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "positioning": {
          "en": "After HOB introduced Bilbo and Key to the Side-Door, aspiringspike was first to try a mono-blue Erayo build. It missed the Top 8 this week but posted two high-score finishes. This version added Basim and more black interaction and did reach a Top 8. The new pieces—including Loki from MSH—are all excellent fits for the strategy.",
          "zh": "HOB带来Bilbo和Key to the Side-Door之后，aspiringspike率先尝试了纯蓝版本的伟代套牌，不过本周没有八强成绩，只有两个高分。而这个版本是加入了Basim和更多黑色互动，本周取得一个八强。包括MSH补的Loki在内，新组件确实都非常适合这个思路。"
        },
